WEBVTT

00:09:29.353 --> 00:09:33.647
Texting has developed one from this slash.

00:09:33.647 --> 00:09:36.632
So we have a whole battery of new constructions

00:09:36.632 --> 00:09:39.219
that are developing, and yet it's easy to think,

00:09:39.219 --> 00:09:41.666
well, something is still wrong.

00:09:41.666 --> 00:09:45.441
There's a lack of structure of some sort.

00:09:45.441 --> 00:09:47.347
It's not as sophisticated

00:09:47.347 --> 00:09:49.553
as the language of The Wall Street Journal.

00:09:49.553 --> 00:09:51.327
Well, the fact of the matter is,

00:09:51.327 --> 00:09:53.778
look at this person in 1956,

00:09:53.778 --> 00:09:56.060
and this is when texting doesn't exist,

00:09:56.060 --> 00:09:57.895
"I Love Lucy" is still on the air.

00:09:57.895 --> 00:10:01.658
"Many do not know the alphabet or multiplication table,